# Encrypted blobs are binary: never let a text filter (autocrlf) touch their bytes.
*.enc binary

# The on-device spatial tables and their golden file are generated by the worker
# (PixlAudio-iOS cloud/runpod-worker/schema/v1/spatial/) and carried here as byte-identical copies
# (handoff/, app assets, unit-test resources). Always LF, on every platform: with autocrlf a
# Windows checkout would otherwise append a CR and the copy in the APK would differ.
spatial_preview*.json text eol=lf
